OL,3,AWhat prompted the US bombers to leave
OL,4,ARAF Fairford?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe unexpected mass withdrawal of
OL,7,FAmerica's heavy bombers happened so
OL,8,Fsuddenly on Sunday that it has got
OL,9,Feveryone wondering what prompted it.
OL,11,FAn "abundance of caution," says US
OL,12,FVice-President JD Vance, adding that
OL,13,FWashington felt Iran was doing what it
OL,14,Fhas "done for 49 years... which is
OL,15,Fengage in acts of terrorism against the
OL,16,FUS and against a lot of other people".
OL,18,FAn abundance of panic is how others
OL,19,Fhave seen it.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
